a:2:{s:7:"content";s:3264:"<p><strong><em>Ref No.: APMIA/HO/2019/2002</em></strong></p>
<p><strong><em>Dated: February 05, 2019</em></strong></p>
<p><strong>To,</strong></p>
<p><strong>The Members,</strong></p>
<p><strong>All Pakistan Marble Industries Association</strong></p>
<p>Subject: <strong>FORMATION OF DELEGATION OF ALL PAKISTAN MARBLE INDUSTRIES ASSOCIATION (APMIA) FOR MARBLE IZMIR FAIR, TURKEY FROM 27-30 MARCH, 2019</strong></p>
<p><strong>Respected Members,</strong></p>
<p>This is to inform you that All Pakistan Marble Industries Association (APMIA) has planned to form a delegation of 10 to 15 members to visit Marble Izmir Fair, Turkey to be held from 27-30 March, 2019.</p>
<p>Interested members can contact APMIA Head Office along with the copy of their passport and ID card, so we can send their details for the approval.</p>
<p>Last date of submission is <strong>18th February, 2019 (Monday)</strong></p>
<p><strong>(Note: This facility is only for APMIA members having valid membership, and it would be a self financed visit. All the members of the delegation will bare all of their expenses on their own including air ticketing, boarding, traveling, lodging etc)</strong></p>
<p>Thanking You</p>
<p>Syed Masud Gillani</p>
<p>Secretary General</p>
<p>All Pakistan Marble Industries Association</p>
<p>Subject<strong>BUSINESS VISA REQUIREMENTS FOR TURKEY</strong></p>
<p><strong>Respected Members,</strong></p>
<p>Following are the business visa requirements to visit Turkey to attend Izmir Stone Fair in Izmir, Turkey to be held from 27-30 March, 2019</p>
<ul>
<li>Visa Application Form with two(2) photographs (White Background – 5x5cm), biometric (Visa form should have the same photo)</li>
<li>Visa Interview Form (Given by Gerry’s office)</li>
<li>Request Letter by Applicant</li>
<li>Passport / Travel Document along with copies of the recent and old passports (If lost, Attested Police Report and it’s English Translation)</li>
<li>Travel health insurance certificate</li>
<li>Polio vaccination certificate</li>
<li>Copy of the flight reservation / booking</li>
<li>Copy of the hotel reservation (Reservation only) or invitation letter which mentions accommodation details if applicable</li>
<li>Family registration certificate from NADRA office</li>
<li>In case applicant is owner of a business a statement on a company letterhead paper about purpose of the visit</li>
<li>FBR / NTN / Income / Active Tax Payer Certificate(s) for individual and company which are recently taken from the relevant Tax Offices</li>
<li>Bank account maintenance certificates for personal and company accounts along with original bank statements of the last three (3) months</li>
<li>Recommendation Letter and Membership Certificate from local Chamber of Commerce and Industry</li>
<li>Recommendation Letter and Membership Certificate of related Trade Organization.</li>
<li>Processing fee Rs. 30,000/- in the shape of Bank Draft or Cheque in favor of All Pakistan Marble Industries Association.</li>
<li>In case of applicant is not available or in case of rejection Rs. 10,000 (Rupees ten Thousand only) will be non-refundable.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Last date of the submission is 18th February, 2019 (Monday)</strong></p>
<p>Syed Masud Gillani</p>
<p>(Secretary General)</p>";s:12:"content_meta";N;}